== Style pass (2026-10-15) ==
=== Missing data ===
* Premium print sheet: the Light Side sheet layout is not given in the SWCCG Collecting Encyclopedia 3.2 (removed from Print sheets: "Light Side sheet layout is unknown in the encyclopedia").
=== Marginal cuts ===
* Unsourced commentary cut from Promotion: "That cover and feature are a substantial promotional effort for one premium in a twelve-card enhanced product. Mara was heavily marketed. Her later table presence is a separate question from that history."
* Lead: "CardGuide numbering: 22nd product." (repeats "22nd Star Wars CCG product").
* Card list intro cut as a repeat of the lead: pack contents, and "One pack is the Boushh window; another is Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand."
* Dan Burns quote shortened; full quote (Star Wars Insider 47, p. 52–57): they were working on Enhanced Jabba's Palace, Mara was a Power Card, "so I thought, 'What about the possibility of fleshing her out?'"
* Sources list removed. Uncited items not tied to a sentence: [https://www.starwarsccg.org/collecting/ SWCCG Collecting Encyclopedia] at starwarsccg.org (same work as the cited 3.2 PDF); [https://web.archive.org/web/20081225225012/http://www.decipher.com/starwars/cardlists/index.html Star Wars CCG cardlists] at Decipher.com (archive, 25 December 2008), likely basis for the Card list game text but it sits below <code><nowiki><references /></nowiki></code>, so a ref there would cause a Cite error.
